<!--=============== Crimson Arachna Cult - Faction ====================-->
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.label>深红蜘蛛邪教</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.label>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.description>古老的危险的黑曜石邪教，将蜘蛛视为神明崇拜，几个世纪前就被完全消灭了...但深红蜘蛛邪教幸存了下来，幸存的追随者隐藏在街道的阴暗深处和阴影中，逐步在黑曜石及其殖民地上扎根影响。在吸收了足够的影响力、权力和技术后，邪教再次向世界展示自己，以消灭所有异教徒！\n\n邪教完全拒绝与其它派系建立任何关系，除了敌对关系。</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.description>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.leaderTitle>维齐尔</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.leaderTitle>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.pawnSingular>邪教徒</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.pawnSingular>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.pawnsPlural>邪教徒</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.pawnsPlural>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.fixedName>深红蜘蛛邪教</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.fixedName>
<ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.messageDefendersAttacking>来自{1}的{0}正在攻击你的{2}。</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.messageDefendersAttacking>

